&lt;p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0in;margin-right:-.5in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify'>&lt;b>&lt;span
style='font-size:12.0pt'>            &lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;span style='font-size:12.0pt'>We
teach that the Bible is God’s revelation to us and that it is the sufficient
guide for what we believe and practice (1 Corinthians&lt;b> 2&lt;/b>:7-14; 2 Timothy &lt;b>3&lt;/b>:16-17).&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>